									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>NEONOVA Puzzle: Orange</strong> is an atmospheric <strong>anime jigsaw puzzle game</strong> that combines Halloween-inspired cyberpunk aesthetics, captivating anime girls, and vibrant orange neon art. Assemble beautiful illustrations, connect puzzle pieces, and immerse yourself in a futuristic world of glowing lights, mysterious characters, and spooky Halloween-inspired imagery.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Step into a mesmerizing <strong>neon cyberpunk world</strong> where futuristic technology meets the mysterious charm of Halloween. Explore striking anime illustrations filled with luminous orange lights, atmospheric shadows, stylish characters, and sci-fi details. Every puzzle reveals another glimpse into this colorful digital universe.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Drag and arrange jigsaw pieces, match colors and contours, and carefully restore detailed illustrations. Pay attention to glowing neon patterns, subtle color transitions, and intricate visual elements as each correctly placed piece brings the complete image closer to life. Every completed puzzle unlocks a new illustration, gradually expanding your personal gallery of <strong>Halloween-inspired anime artwork</strong>.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5398470/extras/b3676f4b5446af5b7250965a5d9c6fd2.poster.avif?t=1793968982" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5398470/extras/b3676f4b5446af5b7250965a5d9c6fd2.webm?t=1793968982" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5398470/extras/b3676f4b5446af5b7250965a5d9c6fd2.mp4?t=1793968982" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >With <strong>50 levels and a variety of puzzle piece shapes and layouts</strong>, NEONOVA Puzzle: Orange offers an enjoyable combination of classic jigsaw gameplay, visual challenges, and relaxing entertainment. Each new picture invites you to explore another futuristic scene while exercising your concentration, visual perception, and attention to detail.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whether you enjoy <strong>casual puzzle games</strong>, relaxing anime jigsaw puzzles, atmospheric cyberpunk games, or spooky Halloween aesthetics, NEONOVA Puzzle: Orange invites you to unwind and explore a futuristic neon world at your own pace. Discover captivating anime girls, assemble colorful illustrations, and enjoy the satisfaction of completing every picture.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >With its distinctive <strong>orange neon aesthetic</strong>, vibrant 2D anime visuals, soothing electronic soundtrack, and intuitive mouse controls, NEONOVA Puzzle: Orange delivers a relaxing single-player puzzle experience. Perfect for anime enthusiasts, jigsaw puzzle lovers, and players who appreciate beautiful sci-fi artwork with a touch of Halloween mystery.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Key Features</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>50 jigsaw puzzle levels</strong> – Assemble detailed anime illustrations and unlock beautiful artwork as you progress.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Captivating anime girls</strong> – Discover stylish characters surrounded by futuristic technology and mysterious Halloween-inspired aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Halloween cyberpunk atmosphere</strong> – Explore a striking visual world combining spooky motifs, glowing orange neon lights, and futuristic sci-fi imagery.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Classic jigsaw puzzle gameplay</strong> – Drag, arrange, and connect puzzle pieces to restore colorful illustrations.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Various puzzle shapes and layouts</strong> – Enjoy different piece designs that bring variety to traditional picture puzzles.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Unlockable artwork gallery</strong> – Complete puzzles to reveal and collect vibrant anime cyberpunk illustrations.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Relaxing electronic music</strong> – Immerse yourself in a soothing soundtrack that complements the futuristic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Colorful 2D anime art</strong> – Enjoy detailed illustrations featuring vivid neon colors, atmospheric lighting, and Halloween-inspired visual elements.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Simple, intuitive mouse controls</strong> – Assemble puzzles comfortably with straightforward mouse-based gameplay.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Visual puzzle challenges</strong> – Exercise your concentration, observation skills, and attention to detail.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> – Complete puzzles and unlock achievements throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Steam Cloud support</strong> – Keep your game progress synchronized across supported devices.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong> – Solve jigsaw puzzles at your own pace and enjoy the atmospheric neon world.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Assemble. Discover. Relax. Embrace the mysterious neon world of NEONOVA Puzzle: Orange!</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
